{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Eko and the Bewitched Lands</strong> is a single player action rogue-like. Explore and find the castle where the Dark Queen has imprisoned your friend and princess of the realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786440/extras/Princess.png?t=1742730552\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786440/extras/Banner_Upgrades.png?t=1742730552\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786440/extras/Upgrades.png?t=1742730552\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your abilities and enhance your playstyle! Each run offers unique and powerful upgrades, letting you adapt, experiment, and evolve your strategies. Will you harness fire, water, or something entirely different?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786440/extras/Banner_RandomMaps.png?t=1742730552\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786440/extras/GeneratedMap.png?t=1742730552\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience endless replayability with procedurally generated levels! Each journey through the Bewitched Lands offers new maps, hidden secrets, and fresh challenges, ensuring no two adventures are ever the same.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DEMO FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 Full Worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 Elements (fire,water,thunder,shadow)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 Bosses and 10 Enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">16 Random Upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 Special Card Ultimates</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 Random Puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Permanent Progression (Meta)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Temporal Progression (Run Progression)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Save System (play as much as you like ;) )</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2786440?t=1742730552","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2786440?t=1742730552","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786440/fb209bf31e5408d158d39107d8bb0d89bf7d501d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742730552","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786440/fb209bf31e5408d158d39107d8bb0d89bf7d501d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742730552","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2932640,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Eko and the Bewitched Lands</strong> is a single player action rogue-like. Explore and find the castle where the Dark Queen has imprisoned your friend and princess of the realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786440/extras/Princess.png?t=1742730552\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786440/extras/Banner_Upgrades.png?t=1742730552\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786440/extras/Upgrades.png?t=1742730552\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your abilities and enhance your playstyle! Each run offers unique and powerful upgrades, letting you adapt, experiment, and evolve your strategies. Will you harness fire, water, or something entirely different?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786440/extras/Banner_RandomMaps.png?t=1742730552\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786440/extras/GeneratedMap.png?t=1742730552\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience endless replayability with procedurally generated levels! Each journey through the Bewitched Lands offers new maps, hidden secrets, and fresh challenges, ensuring no two adventures are ever the same.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DEMO FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 Full Worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 Elements (fire,water,thunder,shadow)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 Bosses and 10 Enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">16 Random Upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 Special Card Ultimates</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 Random Puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Permanent Progression (Meta)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Temporal Progression (Run Progression)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Save System (play as much as you like ;) )</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Twin Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786440/header.jpg?t=1742730552","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257111956,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257111956/movie480.mp4?t=1741421618","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers